WEBVTT

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.020
If I'm going anywhere, I guess that
would be the place.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:34.190
Yes, by tomorrow.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.530
It'll be delivered.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:40.240
Anyway, we nabbed the cosmetic
surgeon's personal data...

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.570
Well, we acquired it.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:47.180
The skin texture is the same, down to
the blemish hidden by makeup.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.080
It's the real thing no matter
who looks at it.

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:51.970
Please look forward to it. Until then.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.480
I don't think it'll be ready by tomorrow.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.650
I'm on my way!

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.130
She said she has a date.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.970
For real?!

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:14.560
Seems like an old friend.
This is me imitating you.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:18.240
Didn't think she had someone like that.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.840
She's reunited after a long separation

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.210
and their passionate flames of love burn
into the color of melanin pigment.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.910
Oh, no!

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:28.120
Do whatever you please with me!
An Okinawa rail! Yeah, right.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.080
She might say some nonsense like that.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:33.360
An old friend, this certainly does
perk some curiosity, doesn't it,

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.560
pointy-haired Harada?

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:37.390
Not really. Even if we look, it's not
going to lead to money.

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:40.520
I see. Then I'm on my way. I'll leave
the house sitting to you.

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:42.230
Where are you going?

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:43.990
This early in the morning?

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.670
Could you possibly be...

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:49.260
You guys want to go too?

00:01:57.110 --> 00:01:59.110
<i>Norikonda sabaibaru cousutaa</i>

00:01:57.110 --> 00:01:59.080
The survival roller coaster we got on

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.850
There's no need to give up,
run by the highway

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:01.550
<i>Akirame muyoude run by the highway</i>

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.420
<i>Kimiwa inochi karagara</i>

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.620
You just barely escaped with your life

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.950
<i>Atashitachimo nodoga karakara</i>

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:06.220
We're thirsty

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:08.150
<i>Kyokugento mugendai</i>

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:08.360
Extremities and infinity

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:10.490
<i>Tomo ni sorette mugendai</i>

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:10.720
Together, they form a fantasy

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:12.390
<i>Kamaeta me hibana chiri</i>

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.590
The eyes, squaring away, are
throwing out sparks

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:15.420
<i>Oni-san kochira to shita o dasu</i>

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.650
"You're it! This way, " you say,
as you stick your tongue out

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.650
<i>Wink</i>

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:17.720
Wink

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:21.330
<i>Kyouretsuna itamini kansha</i>

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:21.540
Grateful for the excruciating pain

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:23.670
<i>Power to iu na no rei de henkan</i>

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.970
I'm restored by a gratitude
known as power

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:29.580
<i>Mou sorosoro okaeri asobareta houga
iinodewa naide shouka</i>

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:29.780
Perhaps it would be better too return soon?

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:38.480
<i>Matsugeno sukima umeruyouni aimeiku</i>

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:38.720
As though filling in the gaps between
the eyelashes, eye make

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:45.790
<i>Kokorono sukima umeruyouni I take</i>

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:45.990
As though filling in the gaps of
my heart, I take

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:50.260
<i>Gekiretsu panchide gyakuni takamaru</i>

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:50.460
On the contrary, the intensity is heightened
by a powerful punch

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:54.730
<i>Yabai shiuchi hodo yokei moechauwa</i>

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:54.800
The worse I'm treated, the more I get fired up

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:59.100
<i>Mouretsu panchide atashi takaburu</i>

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:59.240
I get worked up over an intense punch

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:07.530
<i>Sonna koto shite kurete arigatou</i>

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:08.080
Thank you for doing such a thing

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.050
<i>Sukima sukima sukimani mimai</i>

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:10.250
A gap, a gap, pay a sympathy visit

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:12.050
<i>Janai janai itainjanai?</i>

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.220
Doesn't it, doesn't it, doesn't it hurt?

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:13.720
<i>Mimai tsurai? ltai? Yabai?</i>

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:13.990
Is the visit painful? Does it hurt?
Is it dangerous?

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:18.350
<i>lkitai itai shitai, lkitai itai shitai</i>

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:18.660
I want to go, I want to stay, I want to do it

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.100
Hi, I've been waiting for you.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.640
Hello.

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:31.110
This is where you wanted
to go, Mr. Kurokawa?!

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.300
What are you going to have cut, anyway?!

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:35.740
Don't you think you're being a little rude?

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:38.610
Don't be so fussy since
this is, after all, a job.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:45.610
<i>Mugi-ya</i>

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:44.490
<i>Shell of Lies</i>

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:45.610
Something is not right recently. She seems
to be quietly sneaking out.

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:49.120
We got married after falling madly in love.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:54.050
When I confronted her about this three days
ago, she stopped talking to me.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.370
Well, that completely sounds like she's
having an affair. Well, I shouldn't say that.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:03.300
It's possible you could have misread her
so I can't insist that's what it is.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:08.340
Well, Chairman Taneri here has been
very good to me in the past.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:12.450
While I don't think this is your kind of job,

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:16.180
I can't think of anyone else whose
skills are excellent.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:26.830
Tailing? Wasn't it about
investigating an affair?

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.200
When it comes to tailing someone,

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.290
it has to be about investigating an affair.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:36.130
I imagine I would rather be tinkering
around with an android.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.270
When you decided to tag along, what did
you think this was going to be?

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.180
Well, that's....

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.050
That is to say, why are we
investigating an affair?

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.670
We're not a detective agency.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.090
It's obvious. It's worth money, money.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:53.420
Ah, that's a response I can
understand all too well.

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:54.820
You wrecked the Volkswagen the other day.

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:58.190
A Volkswagen is a vintage vehicle
so the repair costs are expensive.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:00.960
Oh, I hate being poor.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.260
There really isn't anyone who fits the
description of "just my type."

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.260
Here she comes!

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:07.600
Oh, my, my, my!

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.340
She's a blonde so beautiful, she looks
as though she's a portrait.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:14.240
In addition, she's a married walking
pheromone machine with a tight body.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:20.050
Jeez, she's going to waste as the wife of
that loser husband. Moo! Moo!

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.680
What am I? A cow? Am I, beef bowl Harada?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.420
What? You're pretty calm. You're
keeping your cool, Harada.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:30.520
That woman, she gives me bad vibes.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.830
I guess your type is someone younger,
full of energy,

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.390
with pigtails, and that shoots lots of guns.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:41.140
What? What are you talking about?
I'm not really into Mikura.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.530
I didn't mention Mikura.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.060
Okay, back to work.

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:47.940
Hey, wait!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.460
She's a little too fast. Can't catch up!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.940
What are you doing? We'll lose track of her!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.470
My bad, go on without me.

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:21.530
You don't have much stamina.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.510
I'm a naive old man.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:28.620
I'm leaving this up to you.
Jeez, my chest is pounding.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.210
Well, you can't hear this at all, Harada.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.690
Excuse me!

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:36.550
Damn! Where is she?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.400
Wait a...

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.840
Well... I'm in a bit of a hurry, so...

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:51.310
You... Pervert!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.540
Ordinarily, would girls hit
with a clenched fist?

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:07.720
Don't get so depressed, pointy-hair.
There's always tomorrow.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:10.160
There's tomorrow too?!

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.290
For real?!

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:15.560
If you had run, Mr. Kurokawa, this
wouldn't have happened!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:20.170
Hey, I know! There's a great pasta restaurant
around here. Did you know?

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.400
So what about it? It's pasta. I'm all mixed up.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:25.240
As a special service, should I treat
you, Harada? I think I will.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:27.670
Of course, don't say anything about this to
Mikura. It's got to be kept a secret.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.100
Mikura...

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.480
Jeez! If you can't even smell the food,

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:34.680
does that mean you won't be able to
eat your meal either?

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:40.650
Shrimp doria.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.990
A dreary doria! I'm telling you the pasta
here is delicious. I'm not kidding.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.460
Shrimp doria.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.190
One spicy tomato pasta,
pile it onto the plate.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:56.800
Spaghetti is certainly determined
by how it's boiled.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.770
Harada, instead of eating that doria, how
about having some of this stuff instead?

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:05.040
You certainly do like noodles.

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:10.020
People call me, "Noodle Kurokawa. "
It's true, really true.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:11.590
Who's the person behind me?

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:16.220
Even so, that doesn't mean I'm helplessly
addicted to it. I'm just particular about them.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.630
Don't you have anything you're
particular about as well?

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:21.250
Well, I do have a liking for tomatoes.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.100
That's right!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.620
Lycopene is good for your body so it's best
to take a good bite out of one.

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.440
It's best to eat it with a little bit of salt.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.200
Don't you think it's with mayonnaise?

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.600
Never mind that, Mr. Kurokawa.
About that blonde...

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:41.280
It's her! Found the blonde!
Thank you, God. Thank you.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.890
This time, don't lose sight of her.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:49.580
I know, I know.

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:09.580
Let's go, Harada!

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.650
Asami!

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:28.730
By the way, Asami, this is an assignment.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.270
I have free time, so...

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.760
We're not playing around!

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:34.760
But I want to be like Mikura.

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:38.610
Oh, Mikura...

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:40.310
Mr. Harada?

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:42.840
Oh, don't mind him. He's just doing a
comedy relief routine by himself.

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.370
Right, Harada?

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.250
What? Say what?

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.510
Inside or outside, which do you prefer?

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:55.050
Inside! Since this is how it is, I'll
teach that adulteress a lesson!

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:57.490
This is an investigation, an investigation.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.030
We're only supposed to
seize some evidence.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.860
We're not supposed to seize
and then screw it up.

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:03.060
Well, I'll be waiting outside.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:06.300
Leave it to me! Just you wait!

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.600
Whatever you do, don't screw up!
Do you understand?

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.570
Hey, Asami! Don't do it!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.440
I'll be back by dinner.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:15.700
Dinner?

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:19.900
Howdy!

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:23.580
Excuse me, but...

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:27.060
What? Well, is this place members only?

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.360
No, we can't let a minor enter the premises.

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:30.590
What? Me?

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.460
Asami! How many times do I need to tell
you before you understand?

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.430
We're not playing around.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:41.940
I know. That's why I want to seriously help.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:42.990
Asami!

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:47.510
With our jobs, if we're unlucky, we'll die.

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:49.180
They're dangerous jobs like that.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:52.040
If you get dragged in and something
happens to you,

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:54.370
Mikura will cry. Definitely.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:57.980
Do you understand?

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:00.850
All right.

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.450
Mr. Kurokawa! She's meeting with
some man after all!

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:33.320
What? A photo, right?

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:43.190
What? That man? Where have I seen..

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:46.100
Hey! Be careful!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.330
Hey! You're that pervert from this morning!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.910
You're the clenched fist bitch!

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:52.970
Why are you even here?!

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:56.710
I wasn't copping a feel! My hand
just bumped you there!

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.980
Oh, damn!

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:01.920
Did I blow my cover?

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:03.850
What?!

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:05.820
At least apologize!

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.950
Why the hell do I need to apologize?

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:09.680
What?

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:16.250
What the hell's with her? Oh, I can't
just stand around like this!

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:23.170
Damn!

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:25.670
What?

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.700
What was that?

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:32.140
Mr. Kurokawa! He's running your way!

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:36.750
He opened fire all of the sudden!

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:40.150
Why did he open fire? It's just an affair.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.520
Oh, they're here.

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:49.430
So that's the guy she's having an affair with.

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.270
Mr. Harada!

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:58.900
Are you all right, Asami?

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.300
Yeah.

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:08.210
Something certainly stinks around
here, but I'm not angry.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:23.220
Police
Can you chase after the taxi in
front of you? Quickly.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.560
Yeah! I've always wanted to do that!

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:29.500
Is he stupid? What's he going to
do by leaving us behind?!

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.630
Take that!

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:33.540
Harada, nice pitch.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.740
Anyway, we need to go after them!

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:39.610
That's what I'm thinking, but all of a sudden,
no more cars are coming this way.

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:41.050
Man, you see what I mean?

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.570
Maybe because of that?

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.450
Emergency vehicles passing by.
Emergency vehicles passing by.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.220
Yes, emergency vehicles passing by.

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:49.420
For now, I guess we ought to
make a run for it.

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.520
See you later, Asami.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.230
Hurry, this way!

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:07.640
There's never a cab when you need one.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.840
Harada, what are they doing?

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.970
They're still on the move.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.240
Then we might as well do it now.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.780
What? We're going do it?

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.430
Hey, wait already!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.840
Now I can buy the broiled corn with this!

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:55.190
Hurry it up already.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:03.160
While my cover's been blown, don't
you think a disguise is overkill?

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.890
That pointy head of yours is
an attention getter.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:09.200
Hey!

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.140
What's the matter, Harada?

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.110
This way!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.700
Creepy...

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:19.150
What's the meaning of this, Harada?

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:22.280
It's the clenched fist bitch! Clenched fist!

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:24.880
Jeez, is today my unlucky day or what?!

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:27.250
I have no luck today.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.990
Did you say something about pork noodles?

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.120
Hey, they stopped.

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:31.790
Where is this place?

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:32.790
Hey, good timing.
Where is this place?

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.520
Hey, taxi! Stop! I'm so cool.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.560
Let's see...

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.540
Harada, that.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.440
That, that. Not me, that.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:55.210
That's the taxi of the cab driver who
jumped the gun and left us behind.

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:59.480
Yeah, was he waiting for us to arrive?
How conscientious.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:03.420
Harada, I can feel something really
dangerous in the air. I can feel it in my skin.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:06.860
It really tingles. Don't let your
guard down. Over.

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:08.590
Okay.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:21.400
Mr. Kurokawa, this really doesn't look good!

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:24.180
You're right. He's dead.

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.300
Oh, damn!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.510
Toss your gun aside!

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:32.720
Why do we have to deal with this on
a simple adultery investigation?

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:34.520
Under these circumstances,

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.490
there's really not much we can do other
than to do what he says.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:43.190
Turn and face this way, slowly.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:47.730
Oh, my, you've got a better
mustache than I do.

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.600
I purposely lured you here.

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:54.480
Who hired you?

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:58.340
Well, we were asked to investigate the
behavior of the missus over there.

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:00.980
Taneri hired you?

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:02.080
Well, yeah.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.580
I see.
Well, yeah.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.680
So you're only affair investigators?

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:07.380
Only?

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:11.020
That chairman's got a big screw
loose in his head.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.690
Mr. Detective, your timing's just awful.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:16.930
Go inside.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.570
Hey, may I ask something?

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:28.910
Asking me anything now is meaningless,

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:30.980
because you're going to die here.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:34.740
Killing detectives just for investigating
an affair is meaningless too.

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:37.890
The taxi driver really met a tragic end.

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:39.720
He didn't have anything to do with this.

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:43.790
Wasn't it three days ago? That is,
when they were swapped?

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.190
Harada?

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:51.450
He did say his wife stopped talking
to him three days ago.

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:54.340
In order to keep the ruse from unraveling,

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.430
you made her not speak
as much as possible.

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:59.370
Just like with an autograph session attended
by some idol's body double.

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:01.040
Why you...

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.810
This blondie is a love-android?

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.800
What was the deal with her anyway?

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:09.180
I did think she was strange to begin with,
and now that I see her up close,

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:13.210
the dilation of the pupils hasn't
been done very well.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:16.350
An amateur wouldn't notice it.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.730
Same occupation? You got me there.

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:20.790
You're Lloyd Ando, aren't you?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.930
I was thinking I'd seen you around
somewhere before.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:29.670
You sell host robots to rich wives, making
plenty of money off of them.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.830
You're an artificial host buyer.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.230
Shut up!

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.040
Mr. Kurokawa!

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.580
Jennifer, kill them!

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:57.360
Blondie, over here! Here!

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:00.390
Harada, now!

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:09.710
Not good! She's going to
self-destruct! Not good!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:12.280
Harada! Begin blondie capturing plan!

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.510
What is that anyway?!

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.720
The "We Capture Her and Toss Her Outside

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:17.620
Because There's No Other Way
to Be Saved" plan!

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:20.680
Other than Mikura, no one can pull
off that kind of plan!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:25.850
Holy! Reminds me of the Hiyodori Pass!

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.870
All right! Heave!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:32.260
Ho!

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:41.940
Splendid! Nice sliding!

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:43.880
I tried imitating Mikura.

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:46.980
If you try, you can really do
something, Harada.

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:49.980
Please tell her how good I looked.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:51.580
Oh, I will, I will.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:55.660
What? Ow! Oh, the pain!
This is getting old.

00:19:55.660 --> 00:20:00.090
We can do quite a bit without
Mikura, can't we?

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:05.130
Don't get carried away now. What we
just accomplished was a fluke.

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:16.080
What was that guy's goal, anyway?

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:19.810
Rather than that, I wonder if this job will
result in any money? Money, money, money.

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:22.680
"By the way, your wife was a love-android. "

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:30.320
Mikura?

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:34.130
What? What are you doing here?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.930
Ando?!

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:39.600
You know this guy?

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:45.030
Sorry! He had a scary look on his face and
attacked me, so I kicked his ass.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.240
Attacked? You?

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.970
By the way, why are you even here?

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.210
Well, I had some trouble here and there...

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:56.050
Oh, yeah, yeah. This person,
maybe he attacked me

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:57.980
because he mistakenly thought that
thing was discovered?

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:06.790
The blondie, tight-bodied,
pheromone wife. Damn it.

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:08.690
Oh, I'm having a cow.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:13.260
What's that? Pops, what's with
the tight-body thing?

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:22.740
Say, was this a bad guy?
It was okay to beat him up?

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.870
It's all okay.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.540
You'll tell us everything, won't you,
Mr. Lloyd Ando?

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:33.050
Jennifer was a very good customer,
buying up my host robots.

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:37.320
Jennifer hired me to make a copy of herself.

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:40.030
She could leave the copy at home
and while she did that,

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:41.790
she could have as many
affairs as she wanted.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:44.090
Then I thought of something.

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:48.070
You murdered the wife and had the
android do some stealing.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:50.270
I see. I'm having a cow again.

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:51.830
What are those things?

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:56.040
Well, probably some vital data
concerning Taneri Industries.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:59.240
He could make a mint by selling them to the
highest bidder. Money, money, money.

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:02.250
If you guys hadn't come along...

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:04.990
We were only investigating an affair.

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:08.120
If you're going to hold a grudge, hold one
against the wife's habit of having affairs.

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:09.660
While you're at it, will you give
us some money?

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:11.320
Say, where's Mikura?

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:25.840
How should I explain this to
the chairman, poor guy?

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:28.580
But it can't be helped I don't
have money either.

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:30.980
Well, before that, need to go to the police.

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:37.450
Say, Mikura.

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:38.450
What?

00:22:38.450 --> 00:22:41.290
What was that trouble you mentioned
you had earlier?

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:43.450
Oh, it was a fight, a fight.

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:45.830
I hadn't seen my friend in a while, but...

00:22:45.830 --> 00:22:50.100
Today, that friend you spent your day with...

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:51.300
What does it matter?

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:53.060
It's none of your business anyway.

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.200
Well, that's true, but...

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:01.180
Today wore me out.

00:23:01.180 --> 00:23:03.710
I'm hungry. Let's get something to eat!

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:07.250
Sure, sure thing. How about
some curry noodles?

00:23:07.250 --> 00:23:09.280
Noodles again?!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.220
<i>Shell of Lies</i>

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.790
