00:24:41.880 --> 00:24:43.640
What? Mikura hasn't had much screen time?

00:24:43.640 --> 00:24:46.780
Well, while we were chasing after the blondie
tight-bodied pheromone madam,

00:24:46.780 --> 00:24:48.850
it looks like there was something dangerous
going on at the time, going on, going on.

00:24:48.850 --> 00:24:49.750
Don't jerk me around here.

